          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Phat is a traditional trick-taking card game using 52-card French-suited pack for 4 in partnerships players. It is an English partnership game related to All Fours and Don."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Phat is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym."
            }
          ]
        },
