              "text": "52-card French-suited pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card French-suited pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal 52-card French-suited pack to 4 in partnerships players according to the local rules before trick play begins."
